```ts
// Supply values before execution when the section's code needs them.
const md = markrun.pull('@:# Greeting', { name: markrun.args[0] ?? 'world' });
console.log(md);

// Rendering the same value does not rerun its code.
md.set('name', 'Markrun');
console.log(String(md));
```
---
# Greeting: Hello, {{ name }}
The section computed {{ punctuation }} before it was rendered.

```ts
console.log('Preparing a greeting for', section.get('name'));
section.set('punctuation', '!');
```
